1
00:04:15,789 --> 00:04:21,789
Hayley Mills is at it again !

2
00:08:31,578 --> 00:08:37,578
The Parent Trap II is a family, comedy, tv movie
film directed by Ronald F. Maxwell.

3
00:12:47,368 --> 00:12:53,368
Two best friends plot to get their single parents together
to stop one of them from moving to New York.

4
00:17:03,157 --> 00:17:09,157
Susan Corey / Sharon Ferris, played by Hayley Mills.

5
00:21:18,947 --> 00:21:24,947
Bill Grand, played by Tom Skerritt.

6
00:25:34,736 --> 00:25:40,736
Nikki Ferris, played by Carrie Kei Heim.

7
00:29:50,526 --> 00:29:56,526
Mary Grand, played by Bridgette Andersen.

8
00:34:06,315 --> 00:34:12,315
Brian Corey, played by Alex Harvey.

9
00:38:22,105 --> 00:38:28,105
Florence, played by Gloria Cromwell.

10
00:42:37,894 --> 00:42:43,894
The Parent Trap II is a 1986 American made-for-television comedy film and a sequel to Disney's 1961
film The Parent Trap (which was based on the 1949 book Lisa and Lottie by Erich Kästner).

11
00:46:53,684 --> 00:46:59,684
It is part of the The Parent Trap series.

12
00:51:09,473 --> 00:51:15,473
It premiered on the Disney Channel on July 26, 1986 as a part of
the channel’s “Hayley Mills Film Festival” banner.

13
00:55:25,263 --> 00:55:31,263
Hayley Mills is the only actress that returned from the original film.

14
00:59:41,052 --> 00:59:47,052
She continues to portray Susan and Sharon, the twins who were separated at age one, met up twelve years
later at summer camp, switched places and went on to reunite their divorced parents.

15
01:03:56,842 --> 01:04:02,842
The film focuses on Sharon's daughter, Nikki, who tries to connect her mother
with her best friend Mary's father, portrayed by Tom Skerritt.

16
01:08:12,631 --> 01:08:18,631
It was a success for the Disney Channel and it later spawned two more
made-for-television sequels, both produced in 1989.

17
01:12:28,421 --> 01:12:34,421
The film explores themes of jealousy, single parent,
horseback riding, marriage, sequel.

18
01:16:44,210 --> 01:16:50,210
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
